
(footprint SW_EVP-ASAC1A (layer F.Cu) (tedit 6991274E)
  (descr "Panasonic EVPAS 6.0x6.1mm long-travel SPST tactile switch (EVP-ASAC1A, 1.6 N, 5.0 mm knob), SMD, 2 terminals. Land pattern from the datasheet (ANCTB38E, PWB land pattern for reference): two 2.0x2.0 pads, 4.0 gap, 8.0 overall, so 6.0 mm on centres. The datasheet circuit diagram labels the terminals A (left) and B (right); the pads carry the numbers 1 and 2 instead because that is how the vendor catalogue drawing (LCSC C4365033, package SW-SMD_PANASONIC_EVPASXXX) numbers them and the orientation ledger pairs pads by number. Body 6.0 x 6.1, knob dia 4.6 centred.")
